{"kind":"request","text":"Delete the UI that no reader can reach, or mount it. ui/src/components/SequencePane.tsx and the statementWeight export in ui/src/lib/store.ts are reachable only from ui/test, never from the application entry. They cost review attention and test maintenance while shipping to nobody. Decide one way: remove them with their tests, or mount SequencePane and pin it by rendered markup. Simplicity is worth more than a spare pane.","body":{"conditions":"Either SequencePane.tsx and statementWeight are removed together with the tests that exist only to exercise them, and no import of them remains anywhere; or SequencePane is rendered from the application entry and a test asserts its rendered markup, failing when the render site is removed. Whichever is chosen, a fresh make ui build is byte-identical to the committed embed, the UI suite passes, and go vet and go test are green. Approved at an exact head by a reviewer other than the author.","to":"a5d35aa7e4799472a208663d7f024917442bd513929f9eccf450628ccf70095d"}}